Description: guided LAN-only browser workspace for Klipper hosts
 Klippix provides a browser terminal, guided KIAUH installation instructions,
 and a printer-focused file manager shell for Debian-family Klipper hosts.
 Klipper and related printer services remain explicitly user-installed.
